# No casts

SSOT: [`docs/standards/types-and-naming.md`](../../docs/standards/types-and-naming.md).

- No `as` / `as any` / `as unknown as` / `!`. Narrow with Schema or predicates.
- `satisfies` named types only; `as const` OK.
- Sole exception: pure type-level boundary, provably safe, with `// SAFE: …`.
